<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Custom Promise Wrapper</title>
</head>
<body>

    <h1 id="result"></h1>

    <script src="main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
//JS
function wait(ms) {
    return new Promise((resolve) => {
        setTimeout(() => {
            resolve("Operation completed!");
        }, ms);
    });
}

wait(2000).then((message) => {
    document.getElementById("result").textContent = message;
});

//KEYWORD
setTimeout()
    ↓
Promise ichiga "o‘radik"
    ↓
wait()
Asynchronous operation
       ↓
   new Promise()
       ↓
    resolve()
       ↓
    .then()
wrapper → bir narsani boshqa narsa ichiga o‘rash
Promise → asynchronous natijani boshqaradi
resolve → muvaffaqiyatli natija
reject → xato natija
setTimeout → vaqt kutish
.then() → Promise natijasini olish
